<title>FRANCE: Cie Bancaire nine-month results due Wed.</title>
<headline>Cie Bancaire nine-month results due Wed.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compagnie Bancaire, a bank in which Paribas has a 44.50 percent stake, said it would publish its nine-month results for 1996 on Wednesday November 20 at 0700 GMT.</p>
</text>
